OL,3,GNEWSACouncil seeks government help over
OL,4,ALocal Plan row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has asked the government if
OL,7,Fit can help find a solution in a row
OL,8,Fover plans to build on 14 greenbelt
OL,9,Fsites in South Yorkshire.
OL,11,FSheffield's Local Plan is a blueprint
OL,12,Ffor how the city will be developed up
OL,13,Fto 2039, but it has prompted hundreds
OL,14,Fof objections from local residents,
OL,15,Fwith Sheffield actor Sean Bean also
OL,16,Fjoining the lobby to protect fields
OL,17,Fnear his childhood home.
OL,19,FObjectors have voiced their anger that
OL,20,Fthe majority of the 3,500 homes,
OL,21,Fcemeteries and schools were planned for
OL,22,Fjust the S35 and S12 postcode areas.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
